                <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" value="RELATIONSHIP NOTES&#xa;• Every FK shown as NN is NOT NULL in the model.&#xa;• User → Wallet is one-to-zero-or-one because wallets.user_id is unique.&#xa;• Wallet → Mini Wallet, Wallet → Budget, Wallet → Transaction, Mini Wallet → Transaction, User → Savings Goal / Investment / Debt / Recurring Payment / Notification, and Debt → Debt Repayment are one-to-many.&#xa;• Notification.recurring_payment_id is nullable, so a notification may have no recurring payment.&#xa;• Delete behavior follows the declared foreign keys/cascades; actual database cascade behavior also depends on database FK enforcement.&#xa;• Derived balances are Python properties, not stored columns." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="250" width="720" x="680" y="820" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
